  "paragraphs": [
    "Normally, calendars should not have overlapping events—but life is more mysterious than that.",
    "Quiet, Busy and Packed show 4, 20 and 60 appointments across four people. Start times are scattered across the working day, so any overlaps arise from the schedule. Rows grow only when they need more room."
